WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.358
It was the first night of Hanukkah.

2
00:00:03.359 --> 00:00:08.822
We lit the menorah!

3
00:00:08.823 --> 00:00:12.272
It was the second night of Hanukkah.

4
00:00:12.273 --> 00:00:16.115
We played spin the dreidel!

5
00:00:16.116 --> 00:00:20.252
It was the third night of Hanukkah.

6
00:00:20.253 --> 00:00:25.291
We made potato pancakes!

7
00:00:25.292 --> 00:00:28.613
It was the fourth night of Hanukkah.

8
00:00:28.614 --> 00:00:33.562
We sang songs!

9
00:00:33.563 --> 00:00:37.286
It was the fifth night of Hanukkah.

10
00:00:37.287 --> 00:00:40.916
We ate doughnuts!

11
00:00:40.917 --> 00:00:44.202
It was the sixth night of Hanukkah.

12
00:00:44.203 --> 00:00:49.229
We opened presents!

13
00:00:49.230 --> 00:00:52.818
It was the seventh night of Hanukkah.

14
00:00:52.819 --> 00:00:55.897
Grandma and Grandpa came over!

15
00:00:55.898 --> 00:00:59.547
It was the eighth night of Hanukkah.

16
00:00:59.548 --> 00:01:05.116
We ate chocolate!

